# .cursorrules
PROJECT: Laravel 12+ API with Service Pattern and Inertia.js (Vue 3 Typescript) Admin frontend
Key Dependencies: 
- JWT for API auth
- Inertia.js server-side and client-side
- Vue 3 Composition API
- Tailwind CSS for styling
CODING STYLE:
- Controllers are thin, only handle HTTP logic
- Business logic goes in Service classes
- Use Dependency Injection for services
- Return JSON responses which is defined in the App\Utilities::Ok method
- Return Inertia responses for the Admin Inertia which is defined in the App\Utilities::InertiaOk method
- Use Laravel Resources for API responses
- Use Validation Request Class for validation
- Follow PSR-12 coding standards
- Use type hints and return types everywhere
- Service methods throw custom exceptions
- Use TypeScript for the admin frontend

